<title>POLAND: POLISH CELULOZA PAPER FIRM HEAVILY OVERSUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>POLISH CELULOZA PAPER FIRM HEAVILY OVERSUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The public offering of 7.5 million shares or 15 percent of Polish paper firm Celuloza Swiecie SA was oversubscribed with the final strike price set at 20.5 zlotys at a special bourse session, the bourse said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement on Tuesday that investors placed 23,706 bids for Celuloza shares and the average allotment rate was 34.64 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
